# Options for the e-Paper demo, read by /etc/init.d/S99epaper.
#
#   --v2       SSD1675-class panel, the default
#   --v1       UC8151-class panel, the older 2.7inch HAT
#   --bitbang  drive SPI from GPIO rather than /dev/spidev1.0, for a boot.img
#              whose device tree has not been patched
#   --once     draw one frame and exit
#
# The demo tries the other revision by itself if the panel does not answer,
# so this is only needed to skip that first attempt.
ARGS=""
